# Tests Before Docs

## Order of operations (mandatory)

1. **Make changes**
2. **Run relevant tests** — `cargo test -p <crate>`
3. **Verify tests pass** — do not proceed if any test fails
4. **Update `ai_changelogs.md`** — only after tests pass
5. **Commit** (if requested)

## Rules

- Never update `ai_changelogs.md` before verifying tests pass
- Never skip tests to save time
- If tests fail, fix the issue first — do not document broken code
- Include test results in the changelog entry
